--- !u!1001 &1319227852965960994
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 4057622884236373629}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 4882262320171367339, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Hellenistic Cnidian Lamp\n\nReplica of a 2nd\u20131st century BC oil
        lamp from Cnidus, a key ceramic centre in Anatolia. Part of the Dorian Hexapolis,
        Cnidus was famed for its art and architecture. Hellenistic lamps became mould-made,
        with closed tops, filling holes, and decorative reliefs stamped or engraved.\n\nVenus
        of Willendorf\n\nSmall limestone figure (11.1 cm) from around 28,000\u201325,000
        BCE, found in Austria. Shows a female form with exaggerated features linked
        to fertility or survival. Lacking facial detail, the head has braids or a
        patterned cap. Likely used in ritual and symbolic contexts.\n\nBaby Feeder\n\nSpouted
        clay vessels from infant graves in Bronze and Iron Age Europe. Milk residue
        confirms their use in feeding babies. Often buried with children, they reflect
        early childcare practices. May also have served the sick or elderly, offering
        insight into prehistoric family life."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4882262320171367339, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 4.7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4882262320171367339, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_lineSpacing
      value: -30
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4882262320171367339, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSizeBase
      value: 4.7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4882262320171367339, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_characterSpacing
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4882262320171367339, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_paragraphSpacing
      value: -30
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6782548244708260545, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
