--- !u!1001 &2805567078287209318
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 4057622884236373629}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 4882262320171367339, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Greek Antefix with Medusa\n\nTerracotta roof tile end from Ancient
        Greece with both protective and decorative roles. Features a grotesque face\u2014often
        Medusa\u2014meant to ward off evil. Her wide eyes, gaping mouth, and snake
        hair offered apotropaic power while sealing and shielding rooftop structures.\n\nBoyne
        Valley Grooved Ware Bowl\n\nReplica of Neolithic pottery from Br\xFA Na B\xF3inne,
        based on finds at Newgrange, Knowth, and Dowth. Incised lines and symmetry
        reflect symbolic design. Likely used in ritual settings for food, pigment,
        or offerings in ceremonies tied to passage tombs.\n\nRoman Black Burnished
        Cup\n\nReplica of Romano-British black burnished ware, fired using traditional
        methods at Vindolanda. Wheel-thrown and polished by hand, it has a rich sheen.
        Widely used across Roman Britain, it blends everyday function with fine local
        craftsmanship."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4882262320171367339, guid: c480ee079c800aa42a2a66683d2783ad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 4.7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
